# Architecture

## Data flow

- Public RSC → `src/lib/data.ts` (anon) → RLS published/active only.
- Public forms → `src/lib/public-forms/actions.ts`: honeypot → Turnstile → rate limit → validate → service-role insert → Resend.
- Admin → `src/proxy.ts` session gate → server actions with user JWT → RLS + `permissions.ts`.

## Layers

| Layer | Does | Never |
|---|---|---|
| `src/app/**` | UI, metadata, call lib | service-role secrets; raw SQL |
| `src/components/**` | UI / motion | DB writes; secrets |
| `src/lib/data.ts` | Public reads | Writes; service role |
| `src/lib/public-forms/**` | Form pipeline | Trust client-only validation |
| `src/lib/admin/**` | CRUD + permissions | Skip permission checks |
| `src/lib/supabase/admin.ts` | Service role | Import from client components |
| `src/proxy.ts` | Session UX gate | Row-level auth (RLS does) |

## Hard constraints

- Server Components by default; `'use client'` only for interactive islands.
- Auth gate is `src/proxy.ts` (Next 16), not `middleware.ts`.
- One auth: Supabase Auth only. Revalidate public paths on content save.
